UID:10007477-1776796200-1776805200@unitedarts.org
SUMMARY:Beer and Banjos: Derek Lane’s Kitchen Sink
DESCRIPTION:Mix it up with some jamgrass from Derek Lane’s Kitchen Sink at this week’s Beer and Banjos! Derek Lane (of Into the Fog) blends bluegrass\, rock\, and funk into an improvisational frenzy that’s a joy to behold. \nBeer and Banjos is a free\, family-friendly evening of roots music every Tuesday at Raleigh’s Bowstring Pizza and Brewyard. Hosted by the mighty local musicians known collectively as the Beer and Banjos Allstars\, these weekly concerts feature guest musicians and take place on Bowstring’s spacious patio when the weather allows\, or inside by the bar when rain\, heat\, or cold threaten the vibe. \nTips for the musicians are gratefully accepted (look for a helper walking around with a bucket for cash and QR codes for online tips)\, and don’t forget to check out the merch table. Bowstring serves tasty pizza and other food as well as cold beer and other beverages. \nLearn more about Beer and Banjos events statewide here.
URL:https://unitedarts.org/calendar/beer-and-banjos-derek-lanes-kitchen-sink/
LOCATION:Bowstring Pizza and Brewyard\, 1930 Wake Forest Rd\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27608\, United States
CATEGORIES:Beer and Banjos
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://unitedarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Derek-Lanes-Kitchen-Sink-BB-2026-169-for-event-3acvAT.png
END:VEVENT
